; Bus telegram B8 31 12 VV (a WHO 1 command on point 31 arriving from the bus), value bytes
; 80..FF: the OpenWebNet frame a value byte VV becomes, in three framings: $017 and $117
; (3-digit PIC form) and $17 (2-digit PIC form). The same bytes are sent in every framing.
; Boundary probe of 2026-11-16 and 2026-11-17 on the 13 emulated gateways: 64 value bytes from
; 80 up, those that decode on at least one gateway plus a sample of silent ones. The bytes
; below 80 are in bus-what-byte-map.
;
; Result (stock settings, two identical runs per target, 13 targets): per group below, the
; gateways that forward the frame to the bus or answer it on the event session, and the
; gateways whose daemon crashes. Gateways not named drop the frame.

